  "question": {
    "text": "All the energy released from the reaction <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#10230;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#916;</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">r</mi></mrow></msub><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>193</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math> is used for oxidizing <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> as <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#10230;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>0.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></math><br />Under standard conditions, the number of moles of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> oxidized when one mole of X is converted to Y is<br /><math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>96500</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math>",
