  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">F</mi><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></msup></math> for 1 mole of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>96500</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>0.25</mn></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>48250</mn></math> J/mole<br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>48.25</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math> /mole<br />Energy released by conversion of 1 mole of<br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">Y</mi></math><br /><math><mo>&#8710;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">G</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>193</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">J</mi></math><br />Hence mole of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>+</mo></mrow></msup></math> convert<br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>193</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>48.25</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi></math>",
